@329[23]. "The spirit of judgment" = the Divine truth.

@375[21]. "The breath of His nostrils" = the heavenly life which is from Him.

@405[3]. "Spirit" = life from these things.

@418[3]. "Prophesy unto the wind" = spiritual life, which is life according to the truths of the Word. @419[3].

