@427[4]. In its essence, the spirit is nothing but its affection and thought...

@475[10]. "Spirit" = the Divine truth proceeding from Him; "the spirit of judgment" (Isaiah 4:4) = the understanding of truth thence; "the spirit of expurgation" = the affection of spiritual truth.

@481[3]. "Their blast" (Isaiah 25:4) = the cupidity of destroying.

@483[11]. "The unclean Spirit" (Zechariah 13:2) = evils springing from falsities of doctrine.

