@--[end]. As to the man who is infested by Spirits... this was caused by a state of meditation in which he indulged; but no danger is to be apprehended from them, because he is protected by the Lord. The only means by which he can be cured is conversion, and supplication to the Lord our Saviour Jesus Christ.

