@3971. The acknowledgement of the Spiritual. Signified, Explained.

@--. For the Spiritual, because it is from the Lord, is what makes the spiritual man, and the Spiritual Kingdom.

@4015. The power and disposing of the spiritual man in the natural. Signified, Explained.

