@9152. Under <Life>, see this reference. @9188.

@9383. Why the state of the internal man is called Spiritual.

@9550. For all the Spiritual comes forth from the Celestial.

@9551. Spiritual things in the Natural. Signified.

@9554. From the Spiritual which is from celestial good. Signified.

