@6442. To "devour the spoil" (Genesis 49:27) = to appropriate to Himself those whom He has delivered.

@--[2]. That to "devour the spoil -rapina- or spoil" = to appropriate to himself goods which have been carried off by evils. Illustrated.

@--[end]. See <Spoil-Rapina>.

