@8568[7]. "The springs of waters" (Isaiah 49:10) = the Knowledges of truth from the Word.

@9188[2]. All evil springs principally from the love of self. @HH 555[end].

@9348. All evils spring from the loves of self and of the world. @HH 570.

@10629. Their interiors which abound -scatent- in falsities and evils.

@HH 424. Evil affections which spring from the will.

@DP 38. The spring of these delights is the love of dominating from the love of self. @215[9].

@AR 238[4]. To "make the fountain of Babylon dry" (Jeremiah 51:36) = to extinguish all the truth of that Church from its primes.

